      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Alternatively, type __TRILIUM_PH_0__ and press __TRILIUM_PH_1__Enter__TRILIUM_PH_2__, as described in __TRILIUM_PH_3__Slash Commands__TRILIUM_PH_4__.",
