    {
      "id": "u_472f963752e0381f069b143c_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "A new aside block has a gray background, __TRILIUM_PH_0__Dim grey__TRILIUM_PH_1__ in the palette. To change it, put the cursor inside the block and click the __TRILIUM_PH_2__ __TRILIUM_PH_3__Background color__TRILIUM_PH_4__ button in the toolbar that appears above it. It offers the palette and the color picker (__TRILIUM_PH_5__) of the text background color, described in __TRILIUM_PH_6__General formatting__TRILIUM_PH_7__. __TRILIUM_PH_8__Remove color__TRILIUM_PH_9__ makes the block transparent.",
      "sourceHash": "472f963752e0381f069b143c97b100188860f52f458171a12970a47da11bc0af",
      "context": "Aside blocks > Color",
      "contextHash": "6b452a2a3a121a278a57533778520f17b2f5be3b7bb10d1f4c5db43ac590ecf3",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "新しいアサイドブロックの背景色は、パレット内の __TRILIUM_PH_0__暗いグレー__TRILIUM_PH_1__ （Dim grey）です。変更するには、ブロック内にカーソルを置き、その上に表示されるツールバーの __TRILIUM_PH_2__ __TRILIUM_PH_3__背景色__TRILIUM_PH_4__ ボタンをクリックします。ここにはパレットと、__TRILIUM_PH_5__一般書式設定 __TRILIUM_PH_6__で説明されているテキスト背景色のカラーピッカー（__TRILIUM_PH_7__）が表示されます。 __TRILIUM_PH_8__色の削除__TRILIUM_PH_9__ を選択すると、ブロックが透明になります。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-17T23:34:42.858Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_bb1116ebbf22d5ab50723f88_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Like the colors of text, the background color adapts to the __TRILIUM_PH_0__theme__TRILIUM_PH_1__: Trilium shows it in a lighter or darker shade, so the text stays readable in both light and dark themes.",
      "sourceHash": "bb1116ebbf22d5ab50723f88641e78009e0ba24c26b2a3da3143a7c011f60676",
      "context": "Aside blocks > Color",
      "contextHash": "6b452a2a3a121a278a57533778520f17b2f5be3b7bb10d1f4c5db43ac590ecf3",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "テキストの色と同様に、背景色も __TRILIUM_PH_0__テーマ__TRILIUM_PH_1__に順応します。Triliumは明色または暗色の濃淡で表示するため、ライトテーマとダークテーマの両方でテキストの視認性が保たれます。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-17T23:34:42.858Z"
    },
