    {
      "id": "u_e2d582d2151c417b273be3ad_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "A new aside block sits at the right, with the main text wrapping around it. To place it elsewhere, put the cursor inside it and use the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Box position__TRILIUM_PH_1__ button in the toolbar that appears above it. The menu has two groups:",
      "sourceHash": "e2d582d2151c417b273be3addb704d8595b73043acd576b3ca4e6d227a45afa5",
      "context": "Aside blocks > Positioning",
      "contextHash": "8c23ea4e1aa88aaa75acc9e71fb254d98d7a57c4981f924d276d6d31895aa5fe",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "新しいアサイドブロックは右側に配置され、メインテキストがその周囲に回り込みます。別の場所に配置するには、ブロック内にカーソルを置き、その上に表示されるツールバーの __TRILIUM_PH_0__ボックスの位置__TRILIUM_PH_1__ ボタンを使用します。メニューには2つのグループがあります。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-17T23:34:42.858Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_291e417f058470772540ebd2_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Wrap text__TRILIUM_PH_1__ keeps the block at the side of the note, with the text flowing beside it: __TRILIUM_PH_2__ __TRILIUM_PH_3__Align left__TRILIUM_PH_4__ or __TRILIUM_PH_5__ __TRILIUM_PH_6__Align right__TRILIUM_PH_7__.",
      "sourceHash": "291e417f058470772540ebd2b8a6e0ce4906043c47ee0709fa57e9dc81148170",
      "context": "Aside blocks > Positioning",
      "contextHash": "8c23ea4e1aa88aaa75acc9e71fb254d98d7a57c4981f924d276d6d31895aa5fe",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "「__TRILIUM_PH_0__テキストの回り込み__TRILIUM_PH_1__ 」では、ブロックをノートの側面に配置し、テキストをその横に流し込みます（ __TRILIUM_PH_2__ __TRILIUM_PH_3__左揃え__TRILIUM_PH_4__ または __TRILIUM_PH_5__ __TRILIUM_PH_6__右揃え__TRILIUM_PH_7__）。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-17T23:34:42.858Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_3a28c4e03c58345589c9b5bc_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Break text__TRILIUM_PH_1__ gives the block lines of its own, so the text continues only above and below it. Besides __TRILIUM_PH_2__ __TRILIUM_PH_3__Align left__TRILIUM_PH_4__ and __TRILIUM_PH_5__ __TRILIUM_PH_6__Align right__TRILIUM_PH_7__, this group can also center the block (__TRILIUM_PH_8__ __TRILIUM_PH_9__Align center__TRILIUM_PH_10__).",
      "sourceHash": "3a28c4e03c58345589c9b5bcb021dc24eaa655b733eb9d547ca74fdaa648f878",
      "context": "Aside blocks > Positioning",
      "contextHash": "8c23ea4e1aa88aaa75acc9e71fb254d98d7a57c4981f924d276d6d31895aa5fe",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "「__TRILIUM_PH_0__テキストの改行__TRILIUM_PH_1__ 」では、ブロックに独自の行が割り当てられるため、テキストはブロックの上下でのみ続きます。 __TRILIUM_PH_2__ __TRILIUM_PH_3__左揃え__TRILIUM_PH_4__ と __TRILIUM_PH_5__ __TRILIUM_PH_6__右揃え__TRILIUM_PH_7__のほか、このグループではブロックを中央に配置することもできます（__TRILIUM_PH_8__ __TRILIUM_PH_9__中央揃え__TRILIUM_PH_10__）。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-17T23:34:42.858Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_f0b5b68842369c850bf6af92_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "In the mobile layout, an aside block takes the full width of the note, so the text does not wrap around it and the block cannot be resized.",
      "sourceHash": "f0b5b68842369c850bf6af92967e288eb51c18a3d95eb3ab6c2e22ffd44d8aa5",
      "context": "Aside blocks > Positioning",
      "contextHash": "8c23ea4e1aa88aaa75acc9e71fb254d98d7a57c4981f924d276d6d31895aa5fe",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "モバイルレイアウトでは、アサイドブロックはノートの全幅を取るため、テキストが周囲に回り込むことはなく、ブロックのサイズ変更もできません。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-17T23:34:42.858Z"
    },
